        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "label": "Rationale",
          "text": "The terms are consecutive perfect squares:\n\n\\[\n1=1^2,\\quad 4=2^2,\\quad 9=3^2,\\quad 16=4^2,\\quad 25=5^2\n\\]\n\nTherefore, the next term is:\n\n\\[\n6^2=36\n\\]\n\nThe missing term is **36**."
        }
